<title>USA: FSI International gets Hitachi contract.</title>
<headline>FSI International gets Hitachi contract.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>FSI International Inc said Friday it received an order totalling more than $5 million to provide chemical management systems for Hitachi Semiconductor (America) Inc's new fabrication facility.</p>
<p>The equipment will be installed before December 31, FSI said.</p>
<p>FSI manufactures equipment for the semiconductor industry.</p>
<p>Hitachi Semiconductor is a unit of Hitachi Ltd.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
